<title>USA: CCC says seeks 13,000 tonnes soybean oil for Peru.</title>
<headline>CCC says seeks 13,000 tonnes soybean oil for Peru.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on November 6 for 13,000 tonnes of bulk crude degummed soybean oil for donation to Peru.</p>
<p>The oil was slated for December 14-30 delivery.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
